  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759122,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 All-Time Favorites: Nintendo DS\n\nRelive the golden age of classic gaming with *100 All-Time Favorites* for the Nintendo DS! This mini-game collection, developed and published by Ubisoft, brings together a diverse range of beloved board games, card games, and puzzles, perfect for family fun or solo relaxation. \n\nWhile the title suggests a hundred unique games, the collection offers a wide variety of familiar favorites, including Chess, Checkers, Poker (Texas Hold'em), Blackjack, Bridge, Rummy, Backgammon, Go, Chinese Checkers, and Sudoku.  Beyond these classics, you'll find a \"Games Room\" filled with arcade-style diversions like Bowling, Battleship, and Four-in-a-Row, alongside a selection of bonus unlockable games such as Pip Shot and Dot Link. \n\nExperience the nostalgia and challenge of these timeless games on the go, all within the convenient handheld format of the Nintendo DS. Whether you're a seasoned strategist or a casual player, *100 All-Time Favorites* provides hours of entertainment."
    },
